                <span class="odoo-badge-star">⭐</span>
                <span>Odoo Implementation Experts</span>
              </div>

              <h1 class="odoo-hero-heading">
                Smart Odoo Implementation.<br />
                <span class="odoo-gradient-text">Stronger Business.</span>
